retained in deepseek_v41/upstream/LICENSE. Copied operators identify their
source files and revision; adaptations bind them to Resin's paged storage.
The native batch metadata, paged index expansion and selected-index conversion
kernels adapt prepare_decode_metadata.py, get_kv_index.py and flash_mla_utils.py
from deepinfer/model_executor/layers/tilelang_ops/cuda at that revision.
The DeepSelect dependency is pinned to the matching DeepInfer submodule
revision bfa4507d935f17ebfc3d0f00ff7d3c9a4d0e5c18.

